   "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/shertul-fortress-command-orb.lua",
   "source": "*#LIGHT_GREEN#The device seems to be made of pure crystal. It projects a very accurate map of the known world - including the forbidden continent of the south.\nThere seems to be a hole about the size and form of your Rod of Recall.#WHITE#*",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "special": null,
   "target": "*#LIGHT_GREEN#这个装置似乎完全由水晶制成，里面显现出已知世界的精确地图，包括南部的禁秘大陆。\n上面有一个形状类似回归之杖的小孔。#WHITE#*"
  },
  {
   "args_order": null,
   "component": "tome",
   "entry_id": "795194cf31e5693ec8242be74a3cca7ea31e1b3480c6fe9ae2e34dc0c3b89b5b",
   "line": 6033,
   "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/shertul-fortress-command-orb.lua",
   "source": "[Insert the rod]",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "special": null,
   "target": "[插入魔杖]"
  },
  {
   "args_order": null,
   "component": "tome",
   "entry_id": "511d2eb90ed395e2b94beb7194d0fc86e6d4724c0f7927a6c3b653852a1e1ea7",
   "line": 6034,
   "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/shertul-fortress-command-orb.lua",
   "source": "*#LIGHT_GREEN#As you take the rod close to the orb it seems to vibrate and react.\nA shadow appears in a corner of the room! You retract the rod immediately but the shadow stays.\nIt looks like the horrors you fought when coming inside, only less degenerated.\nThe thing looks roughly humanoid, but it has no head and its limbs look like tentacles. It does not seem hostile.#WHITE#*",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "special": null,
   "target": "*#LIGHT_GREEN#当你用回归之杖接近水晶球时，你感觉到它发生了感应和共鸣。\n一个影子从房间的角落里出现了！你赶紧拿回了回归之杖，但是那个影子还在。\n它看起来很像你进来时战斗过的恐魔，只是退化程度较轻。\n那个东西有着粗略的人形，但它没有脑袋，只有像触角一样的肢体。看上去似乎不像是敌人。#WHITE#*"
  },
  {
   "args_order": null,
   "component": "tome",
   "entry_id": "9784d24abb016640c73372a56c244157b4977ed200a6c10a78f1b3caf80623c0",
   "line": 6045,
   "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/shertul-fortress-gladium-orb.lua",
   "source": "*#LIGHT_GREEN#This orb is used to control the gladium arena.#WHITE#*",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "special": null,
   "target": "*#LIGHT_GREEN#这个水晶球用于控制角斗竞技场。#WHITE#*"
